<https://api.cloud.ai4eosc.eu/v1/catalog/modules/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep/metadata> a it6:MachineLearningModel ;
    it6:hasMachineLearningLibrary <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/library/Keras> ;
    it6:hasRepository <https://github.com/ai4os-hub/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep>,
        <https://hub.docker.com/r/ai4oshub/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep> ;
    it6:hasTaskType <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/tasktype/Classification>,
        <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/tasktype/Other>,
        <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/tasktype/Time_Series> ;
    it6:shortDescription "Thunderstorm nowcast based on radar data (for agrometeorology)"@en ;
    dct:created "2024-10-11"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description """ai4eosc_thunder_nowcast_ml is an application using the DEEPaaS API.

In project is needed software preprocessed [tabular radar data](https://github.com/ai4os-hub/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep/tree/main/data/examples) 
for training and predict severe convective rain. The main goal is to send warning messages to farmers.

<img class='fit', src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ai4os-hub/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep/main/docs/images/radar.png'/>

Algorithm needs CAPPI2000 and VIL (vertical integrated liquid water) radar products for AREAs - local districts.
The both processes of train and predict are fully [configurable](https://github.com/ai4os-hub/thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep/tree/main/data/configs).
You can specify Neural network architecture, forecast time, which Areas include, forecast time, etc. However, you have set same configuration for
prediction as was set during training."""@en ;
    dct:identifier "thunderstorm-nowcast-microstep" ;
    dct:license <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/MIT> ;
    dct:modified "2025-06-25"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:title "Thunderstorm nowcast (MicroStep-MIS)"@en ;
    dct:type <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/category/AI4_inference>,
        <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/category/AI4_pre_trained>,
        <http://w3id.org/ai4os/vocabulary/category/AI4_trainable> ;
    dcat:keyword "convective rainfall warning"@en,
        "deep learning"@en .

